### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email":"test@gmail.com",
  "password": "testpass123"
}

### Login to get JWT tokens
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "testpass123"
}

### Refresh JWT token
POST http://localhost:8000/api/token/refresh/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoicmVmcmVzaCIsImV4cCI6MTc1Mzk2MzM3MywiaWF0IjoxNzQ2MTg3MzczLCJqdGkiOiJhY2M0ODNjNGFiMTM0NTk3YjBiZjY4MjEzMGMyN2JiZiIsInVzZXJfaWQiOjV9.lcYhIV45SUympBf3Yj6S86LxWdgb2smPFNH_05jk7Pk"
}

